    <!-- Vaccine Descriptions -->
    <string name="vaccine_desc_rabies_cat">Essential vaccine for cats that go outdoors. Rabies is a fatal viral disease that can be transmitted to humans. Annual vaccination required. Protects against this deadly virus that affects the nervous system.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_rabies_dog">Essential vaccine for all dogs. Rabies is a fatal viral disease that can be transmitted to humans. First dose includes microchipping. Required by Israeli law. Protects against this deadly virus that affects the nervous system.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_quadrivalent">Protects against 4 diseases: Panleukopenia, Herpesvirus, Calicivirus, and Chlamydia.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_felv">Recommended for outdoor cats. Prevents a viral infection that weakens the immune system, making cats vulnerable to other diseases.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_hexavalent">Protects against 6 diseases: Canine Distemper Virus (CDV), Canine Adenovirus Type 2 (CAV-2), Canine Parvovirus (CPV), Leptospirosis (Two Serovars), Canine Parainfluenza Virus (CPiV), and Canine Coronavirus (CCV).</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_spirocerca">Prevents infection by a parasitic worm common in Israel, which can cause severe illness, including esophageal tumors.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_parkworm">Prevents infestation by a parasitic worm transmitted through beetles.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_kennel_cough">Protects against Kennel Cough, a mild respiratory infection.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_fleas_ticks_cat">Protects against fleas and ticks, preventing severe itching, allergic reactions, and disease transmission (e.g., Hemobartonellosis).</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_fleas_ticks_dog">Protects against infestations that cause skin irritation, anemia, and disease transmission (e.g., Ehrlichiosis from ticks).</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_internal_parasites_cat">Prevents intestinal worms that can cause weight loss, vomiting, and diarrhea.</string>
    <string name="vaccine_desc_internal_parasites_dog">Prevents roundworms, tapeworms, hookworms, and other intestinal parasites.</string>

